{"1772910": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead District: Survival", "steam_appid": 1772910, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/6817ff8db46d8654e65932c315c6b93b.avif?t=1782120730\" width=600 height=152 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead District</strong> is an open-world survival sandbox where every decision matters. You start on a hostile island full of threats: wild animals, deadly traps, the infected and desperate survivors. Your goal is simple — stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your shelter, craft weapons and tools, cultivate food, and explore the island alone or together with friends. Four unique characters are available, each ready to face the struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1772910/extras/39d0cb9d438f637b9152d2d2a8530182.avif?t=1782120730\" width=600 height=175 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up in multiplayer to share resources and defend your base, or test your skills solo. Drive vehicles, hunt, complete quests, and shape your own path in a world that never forgives mistakes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Single-player and multiplayer survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Base building and crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic weather and day/night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Mission and quest system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Farming, hunting and resource gathering</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Driving and combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Four playable characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragra